{"t":"Loose Stone Pile","s":"loose-stone-pile-9de94","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Loose_Stone_Pile_de9144.gif","q":12,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Loose Stone Pile</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Loose Stone Pile\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Loose_Stone_Pile_de9144.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Flora and Minerals<br/>Rocks</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVXBkYXRlcy8zLjE/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Updates/3.1 (page does not exist)\">3.1</span><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20080924160135&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Loose_Stone_Pile_de9144.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a loose stone pile.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Loose stone piles can be found all over Tibia.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p><br/>Loose stone piles can be opened with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a>, which results in the name change from \"loose stone pile\" to \"Hole\". Players can walk down the holes to access lower floors of the map. Monsters are unable to walk into the hole.\n</p><p>Open 500 of these to obtain the achievement The Undertaker. You can find 13 openable holes here. Some are under <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field\">Energy Fields</a>, however, so be sure to bring about 11 <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Runes</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/blood-herb-quest\">Blood Herb Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Rune</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li>Flora and Minerals</li><li>Forlorn Shovel</li><li>Hole (Rock)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Light%20Shovel\">Light Shovel</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Loose%20Stone%20Pile%20%28Omrabas%29\">Loose Stone Pile (Omrabas)</a></li><li>Navigation</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/pick-quest\">Pick Quest</a></li><li>Rocks</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sneaky%20Stabber%20of%20Eliteness\">Sneaky Stabber of Eliteness</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Squeezing%20Gear%20of%20Girlpower\">Squeezing Gear of Girlpower</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/steel-helmet-quest\">Steel Helmet Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleporters</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-desert-dungeon-quest\">The Desert Dungeon Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-gravedigger-of-drefia-quest\">The Gravedigger of Drefia Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-pits-of-inferno-quest\">The Pits of Inferno Quest</a></li><li>The Undertaker</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/to-outfox-a-fox-quest\">To Outfox a Fox Quest</a></li><li>Utilities</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Whacking%20Driller%20of%20Fate\">Whacking Driller of Fate</a></li><li>Wormhole</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["20-years-a-cook-quest","blood-herb-quest","bored-mini-world-change","panpipe-quest","pick-quest","steel-helmet-quest","the-desert-dungeon-quest","the-gravedigger-of-drefia-quest","the-pa